130.6, 130.1, 128.7, 128.1, 126.9, 118.6, 118.4, 62.2, 54.3, 51.2, 34.9,
20.7; ESIMS m/z 466.2 (M + H)+; HRMS calcd for C31H32NO3 (M + H)+
466.2377, found 466.2370.
