$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 1,2,4,5-Tetrakis([1,1′-biphenyl]-2-oxy)-3,6-bis(4-methoxyphenoxy) benzene
(2). To a round-bottomed flask equipped with a Dean-Stark trap, 1 (0.79
g, 2.0 mmol), 2-phenylphenol (2.04 g, 12 mmol), and K2CO3 (1.66 g, 12
mmol) were charged. Then, 1,3-dimethyl-2-imidazolidinone (8 mL) and
toluene (5 mL) were added into the flask under nitrogen. The reaction
mixture was stirred at 150 °C for 2 h. After removal of toluene, the
reaction temperature was increased to 220 °C, and the reaction was
continued for 48 h. After cooling to room temperature, the mixture was
poured into 10 wt % NaOH(aq). The resulting precipitate was collected and
dissolved in DMF. The solution was poured into 10 wt % NaOH(aq), and the
resulting solid was collected and purified by column chromatography on a
silica gel (dichloromethane:hexane = 1:1). A white solid. The yield was
1.73 g (87%). IR (KBr, ν, cm-1); 1250 (-O-), 2939 (-CH3). 1H NMR (CDCl3,
δ, ppm): 3.67 (s, 6 H), 6.38-6.49 (m, 8 H), 6.57 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 4 H),
6.87-6.97 (m, 12 H), 6.99-7.17 (m, 20 H). 13C NMR (CDCl3, δ, ppm): 55.77,
114.13, 114.47, 117.18, 122.68, 126.65, 127.70, 128.06, 129.55, 130.70,
130.98, 137.62, 139.29, 140.18, 151.65, 154.01, 155.00. Anal. Calcd for
(C68H50O8): C, 82.07; H, 5.06. Found: C, 81.73; H, 5.25.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM thermal (in stage 1), Dean-Stark trap used
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Locally and Densely Sulfonated Poly(ether sulfone)s as Proton Exchange
Membrane
