$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 3-Chloro-4-(2-cyano-3-(pyrimidin-4-yl)phenoxy)benzoic acid (45-3).
2-Fluoro-6-(pyrimidin-4-yl)benzonitrile (40 mg, 0.2mmol),
3-chloro-4-hydroxybenzoic acid(53 mg, 0.3 mmol) and potassium carbonate
(138 mg, 1 mmol) was dissolved in dimethyl sulfoxide (20 mL). The mixture
was stirred at 120 °C for 12 hours. Water (40mL) was added to the
mixture. The mixture was extracted with ethyl acetate (20 mL x 3), and
the combined organic layer was concentrated in vacuum. The residue was
purified by preparative-HPLC to give
3-chloro-4-(2-cyano-3-(pyrimidin-4-yl)phenoxy)benzoic acid. White solid,
yield 60 mg, 86%. LRMS(M + H ) m/z: calcd 352; found 352.
